1
00:00:00,866 --> 00:00:04,156
(Amy:)I'm just saying,
second base is right there.

2
00:00:10,375 --> 00:00:13,665
(Raj:)Mm. I'm thinking about adopting
some quirky affectation...

3
00:00:13,837 --> 00:00:18,677
(Raj:)...like a pipe or a monocle
or a handlebar mustache.

4
00:00:20,218 --> 00:00:24,218
(Leonard:)For all those girls out there
Iooking for the Indian Monopoly man?

5
00:00:27,893 --> 00:00:31,233
(Raj:)This is not a safe place.
You can't share anything here.

6
00:00:33,774 --> 00:00:37,194
(Sheldon:)The two of you
need to get your women in line.

7
00:00:39,279 --> 00:00:41,739
(Sheldon:)- What?
- Last night I was strong-armed...

8
00:00:41,907 --> 00:00:46,027
(Sheldon:)...into an evening of harp music
and spooning with an emotional Amy.

